**Spec:** `ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/plan.md` (Global Constraints, C1–C2, L4, Task 1.1); `cookbook/decisions/restart-the-port-from-isaiahs-clean-base.md`; `AGENTS.md`. Read all three before executing. This brief proposes a deliberate refinement of Task 1.1's **workspace** wording: keep a standalone package until there is a real root consumer.

